LeanSelect

This implementation is derived in part from SparDA
(https://github.com/Xnhyacinth/sparda), Copyright 2026 NVIDIA, Apache-2.0.
The extraction retains the Paper1 selector, its objective, relevant backbone
paths and baseline adapters. Public names and entry points have been revised.

Backbone and baseline code retains contributions from OpenBMB, NVIDIA,
Hugging Face, EleutherAI, THUNLP/NOSA and the InfiniGen authors. Original
copyright notices remain in source files. NOSA-derived files carry MIT terms
as well as the terms attached to their incorporated Apache-2.0 code.

The native extension uses OpenBMB/infllmv2_cuda_impl, with FlashAttention
BSD-3-Clause portions and NVIDIA CUTLASS dependencies. Fixed revisions and
the local patch are recorded under third_party/infllmv2/.

LongBench, RULER, HELMET and NOSA reasoning interfaces use separately obtained
upstream code and data. Their revisions are recorded in leanselect/evaluate.py.
Their respective licenses continue to apply. This repository does not bundle
benchmark datasets, model weights, or upstream repository histories.

Applicable third-party license texts and source URLs are included in LICENSE.
